<title>USA: Mazda September US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mazda September US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     5,250	     7,967	    -31.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   3,004	     3,370	     -7.1</p>
<p> Import Car		 5,867	     7,849	    -22.1</p>
<p> Import Truck		 909		 817	    +15.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    69,717	    85,974	    -19.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  33,880	    36,263	     -7.0</p>
<p> Import Car		80,263	    96,792	    -17.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	    10,617	    11,588	     -8.8</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
